  "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#236fa1\">概述</span><br>此资源包为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stay-true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stay True</a> 资源包添加了发光矿石纹理。</p>\n<p>如果您将此资源包与我的 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores\" rel=\"nofollow\">Glowing Emissive Ores</a> 资源包一起使用，请确保将 “Glowing Emissive Ores - Stay True” 放在其上方。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1;text-decoration:underline\">不希望某些方块具有发光效果？</span></span><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如果您不喜欢某些方块（例如煤矿石）具有发光效果，您可以打开资源包并删除该矿石的发光纹理。我个人会移除煤矿石的纹理，因为在开启光影时，它看起来可能是褐色的。示例如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>导航至 “assets/minecraft/textures/block”</li>\n<li>删除 coal_ore_e（发光纹理以 “_e” 结尾）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚠️<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px;text-decoration:underline\">要求：</strong></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">NeoForge 要求：</span></h3>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h3>选项 1 (1.21 和 1.21.1)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> -（使 Fabric 模组在 NeoForge 上运行）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>（NeoForge 版本，1.21.1+）或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Forge 要求：</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>选项 1 (1.16.5 至 1.21.1)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta Emissive Textures (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>选项 2 (1.18.2 或 1.19.2)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/connectedness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Connectedness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rubidium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rubidium</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>选项 3 (1.20.1, 1.21 或 1.21.1)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> -（使 Fabric 模组在 Forge 上运行）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>选项 4 (不推荐)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Fabric/Quilt 要求：</span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>\n<h3>选项 1 (强烈推荐) (1.18.2 至 1.21.5)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a> –（仅在 1.18.2 或更高版本中支持发光纹理）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a> -（非必需，但我强烈建议安装）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a> -（仅在使用低于 0.6 版本的 Sodium 时需要）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong>低于 0.6 版本的 Sodium 与 Continuity 结合使用时，已知会导致 Z-fighting（深度冲突）问题。</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>选项 2 (1.16.5 至 1.21.1)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreMCMeta Emissive Textures (Fabric)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h3>选项 3 (不推荐)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optifabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFabric</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/deftesthawk/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的其他资源包</a></p>",
